        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEESof9JJzQIzN3kpf4chHR+ZdE+7cFAmoce9UACgkQchHR+ZdE\n+7fCng/9G9t8ZNJGC+vfEDFa9ep1ZaLG7p5BmJ1p6A2oDaDOnOj1zApEYyiOqSdw\nVqJ7h3/oWAKRWZhcOSfxpKiB2tZf6jSbIKt0DE/prWp93sNMzj6/2ATRU1BLaFdr\nOuoehr/F5FJTKUJGihzI9AcZgmsLypp/KAj42iT5WttYQwrWpCAMh1qlLD4EACUG\nSrn+UwONVflTl0j0ayg/MkgSbHGE6biep9GGDaVOsOOf1rRIDt3eB+tsRieKegQS\naDzH/RZSxoMyWT3s+yth3WyWOeP9BlPbn9zGkajXVIhF0qE8fO/C/0zye3NgnioY\nWk8+dYJeFOYSNKsccpsGkoYTFTSBmaHodQWcTtVVMhJkExjAFpTTGiFGNdPNN66b\nMirhS70ym1JrWSbbBRCobWvYgdxnNte6Okqk1rXrrbNEpcu4e9nR39WQxLY+tGFu\nqCBzBDVyWyU0HUZRR7mmxI1CFi4cPSF+MvnkJ41azGSGJTqMxXnNABrmTqY9kBvf\ndbX5+17n4rxgg3ve73S5tMDiD+qOenqaR4xkjMVD0JwOO+0zS3p0u7VVDDXx1rMt\noKk4JeocFPD7B+4FV0PLRfb1GlyPqvxypXXgjcTIUYA2DTFVphUsWDtwKSOJG+Ou\ntsIhi5TZuslaq0dsetVPuVtUmU959wQ6SVYHnI3oMHfuJtza6SQ=\n=2NyO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----",
        "payload": "tree a140f786581a3ac8ed6a7854a0d05eac77722f22\nparent beccded68fbd8609d10bd86abbbf53643ce6690e\nauthor Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1780251605 +0200\ncommitter Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1780251605 +0200\n\nKeep feed on screen during refetch instead of flashing empty state\n\nThe feed's render switch (items.length > 0 ? list : empty) used item count\nas the sole gate for the empty state once initial load settled. Several\ninputs to the useFeed query key (mute list, follow list, feed settings)\narrive from background syncs after their localStorage placeholders, churning\nthe key. A key change starts a fresh query with no cached data — placeholderData\nonly bridges refetches of the same key — so rawData becomes undefined and the\npopulated feed collapsed to 'No posts found'. Mobile amplifies this: app\nsuspend/resume forces reconnects and syncs while the user is reading.\n\nAdd useStickyFeedItems, which retains the last non-empty list while the query\nis fetching and only surfaces an empty list once settled. Apply it to the main\nfeed, saved-feed, hashtag, and geotag feeds, and prefer rendering retained\nitems over skeletons on a key-change refetch.\n",
